Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 11:10:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Nester/Team-Leader/Ordering My Work queues; move BOM off
 Batch onto Room

Moves BOM drafting off the Batch lifecycle entirely and onto Room as its
own "BOM Drafted" workflow stage (a Detailer's per-room step, done before
a room is even batch-eligible), simplifying Batch down to a plain
Pending -> Nesting -> Complete lifecycle. Adds a new Ordering role whose
My Work shows every BOM-drafted room whose materials haven't been ordered
yet, and rebuilds My Work as role-aware queues: Nester (batch/nest
BOM-drafted rooms, progress own batches via new GET /batches/mine),
Team Leader/Manager/Admin (an inline review-queue card reusing the room
detail page's approve/send-back UI), Ordering (mark-materials-ordered),
and the existing Detailer queue (now also usable by a Team Leader on
rooms Planning assigned them, since they sometimes do detailer work too).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
